      "message": "The original code casts `av1_warped_filter` to `int16_t *` and then adds `WARPEDPIXEL_PREC_SHIFTS * 8`. Since `av1_warped_filter` is a two-dimensional array:\n\n```\nextern const int16_t av1_warped_filter[WARPEDPIXEL_PREC_SHIFTS * 3 + 1][8];\n```\n\nThe `* 8` part accounts for the size of the second dimension. So the index for the first dimension is `WARPEDPIXEL_PREC_SHIFTS`, not `WARPEDPIXEL_PREC_SHIFTS * 8`.",
